  "usefulExpressions":{"units":[
    {"unitId":"unit-1","printedPage":89,"entries":[["How was your weekend?","你周末过得怎么样？"],["It was great! I climbed the Great Wall.","非常棒！我去爬长城了。"],["What did you do, Leo?","你做什么了，利奥？"],["I visited the \"Gingerbread House\" last Saturday.","我上个星期六去参观“姜饼屋”了。"],["Where did you go over the summer holidays, Binbin?","你暑假去哪儿了，斌斌？"],["I went to Xi'an with my family.","我和家人去了西安。"],["What did you do there?","你们在那里做了些什么？"],["We went to see the Terracotta Warriors.","我们去看兵马俑了。"],["What else did you do?","你们还做了什么？"]]},
    {"unitId":"unit-2","printedPage":89,"entries":[["How was your Mid-Autumn Festival holiday, Binbin?","你中秋假期过得怎么样，斌斌？"],["It was great!","非常棒！"],["Did you take a trip?","你们去旅行了吗？"],["No, we didn't.","不，我们没有。"],["Did you eat mooncakes?","你们吃月饼了吗？"],["Yes, we did.","是的，我们吃了。"],["My mother and I went to a marathon on Sunday.","我和妈妈上周日去看了一场马拉松比赛。"],["What did you like about it?","你喜欢它哪一点？"],["I liked watching the runners.","我喜欢看参赛者（跑步）。"],["What did you do last weekend?","你上周末做了什么？"]]},
    {"unitId":"unit-3","printedPage":89,"entries":[["How do you feel?","你感觉怎么样？"],["I feel ill. My head hurts and I have a runny nose.","我感觉不舒服。我头痛还流鼻涕。"],["I'm sorry to hear that. Maybe you should see a doctor.","对此我感到难过。也许你应该去看医生。"],["How can we live a healthy life?","我们怎样能过健康的生活？"],["We need to eat healthy food. We should exercise too.","我们需要吃健康的食物。我们还需要运动。"],["Have a healthy diet.","（保持）健康的饮食。"],["Don't stay up late.","不要熬夜。"],["Think about happy things.","想开心的事情。"],["Join clubs and teams.","加入俱乐部和团队。"]]},
    {"unitId":"unit-4","printedPage":90,"entries":[["How are you going to spend it?","你打算怎么花（这些钱）？"],["I'm going to buy a schoolbag.","我打算买一个书包。"],["I also want to buy some animal books.","我还想买一些动物类书籍。"],["What else are you going to buy?","你还打算买什么？"],["I'm going to buy a pair of sunglasses for Grandpa.","我打算给爷爷买一副太阳镜。"],["I also want to buy a microscope.","我还想买一个显微镜。"]]},
    {"unitId":"unit-5","printedPage":90,"entries":[["What can you see in the sky?","你能在天空中看到什么？"],["We can see the Sun and clouds.","我们能看到太阳和云。"],["At night, we can see the Moon and the stars.","在晚上，我们能看到月亮和星星。"],["Is there any water on Mars?","火星上有水吗？"],["Yes, there is. There is soil too.","是，有的。那里还有土壤。"],["Are there any aliens?","那儿有外星生物吗？"],["I don't think so. They say there aren't any living things.","我不这样认为。据说那里没有生物。"],["China put a rover on Mars.","中国在火星上放置了探测器。"],["The taikonauts get up early in the morning.","中国航天员很早就起床。"]]},
    {"unitId":"unit-6","printedPage":91,"entries":[["What do you know about it?","关于它你知道些什么？"],["Running water can make electricity.","流水可以发电。"],["What else do you want to know about water?","关于水你还想了解些什么？"],["Where does water come from?","水从哪儿来？"],["Wind power, solar power and water power are types of green energy.","风能、太阳能和水能是不同类型的绿色能源。"],["But many resources are running out.","但是很多资源快要耗尽了。"],["What should we do?","我们该怎么办？"],["How can we save energy?","我们怎样才能节约能源？"],["We can take quick showers.","我们可以快速淋浴。"],["We can also use LED lighting.","我们还可以使用LED照明。"],["We should use air conditioners less.","我们应该少用空调。"]]}
  ]},
